#: ../../Rapid_Mix/RM_Design_Solution.rst:12
msgid "Create a function to return maximum energy dissipation rate along the centerline of a free jet given inputs of distance downstream of the jet (along the centerline), jet velocity, and initial jet diameter. You will find the Rapid Mix powerpoint useful in finding a relationship between these variables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../Rapid_Mix/RM_Design_Solution.rst:14
msgid "Use your function to create a graph of the centerline (maximum) energy dissipation rate as a function of distance from jet origin. \\* Use an initial diameter of DiamJet = 10 cm and a velocity of VelJet = 1 m/s. \\* Use a range of 7 to 20 jet diameters when creating the graph. \\* Use units of meters for the x-axis and W/kg for the y-axis. Make sure to label your axes correctly."
msgstr ""

